.TH XVINFO 1 2025-04-12 "xvinfo 1.1.6" "X Version 11"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
xvinfo \- Print out X-Video extension adaptor information
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.B "xvinfo"
[\fB\-display\fP \fIdisplayname\fP] [\fB\-short\fP]
.PP
.B "xvinfo"
\fB\-help\fP | \fB\-version\fP
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.B xvinfo
prints out the capabilities of any video adaptors associated
with the display that are accessible through the X\-Video extension.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP 8
.B "\-display \fIdisplay\fP"
This argument allows you to specify the server to query; see \fIX(7)\fP.
.TP 8
.B "\-short"
Output less details, to reduce the amount of text.
.TP 8
.B "\-help"
Output program usage, then exit.
.TP 8
.B "\-version"
Output program version, then exit.
.SH "محیط (ENVIRONMENT)"
.TP 8
.B DISPLAY
This variable may be used to specify the server to query.
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.BR X (7),
.BR xdpyinfo (1),
.BR xwininfo (1),
.BR xdriinfo (1),
.BR glxinfo (1),
.BR xprop (1)
.SH "نویسندگان (AUTHORS)"
Mark Vojkovich
